claude: true
prompt: >
  You are working on Alien::gettext, a CPAN Alien::Base tools distribution.
  Read .claude/rules/alien-gettext-rules.md, then pick the highest-priority
  actionable ticket from the karr board (`karr board`), claim it, and complete
  it via the alien-gettext-worker agent. Verify build changes with the forced
  ALIEN_INSTALL_TYPE=share / =system pair before handing off. Never run
  `dzil release`.
